{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Boss 选招｜流程子图\n配置/选招专项已通过；受控Try/原Completed消费者已编译。普通Mesh A→完整返回→B有限通过，严格raw重入失败保留；正式BT战斗/资产/网络待验。\n[[GGYGO_流程_BossAI.canvas|返回主流程]] · [[GGYGO_结构_BossAI.canvas|结构图]] · [[BossAI/结构|完整契约]] · [[计划_BOSSAI|设计与验收]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1940,
      "height": 175,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "tick",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. BT → ChooseBossAction::ExecuteTask。\nClearActionSelection + Blackboard::ClearValue 清旧请求。\n按 BossState::GetCurrentPhaseTag 从 Definition 取得 ActionSet。\nValidateConfiguration 失败 → 整集拒绝并诊断。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "candidates",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. 只保留合法可执行候选。\nBaseWeight=0 禁用；检查 Required/Blocked Tags、距离、角度、视线。\n复制原 SpecHandle 后调用 ASC::CanActivateAbilityByHandle。\n无候选 → Failed，不抽签。",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "random",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. Controller::SelectAction(Set, EligibleTags)。\n读取派生权重；全集合法且候选有正权重时 DrawActionWeight 一次抽签。\nRecordActionSelection 更新权重，StoreActionSelection 保存来源和原 Spec。\nBlackboard::SetValueAsName 写 Tag。",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. ActivateAbility::ExecuteTask 消费请求。\nConsumeActionSelection核对原Set/Phase/\nASC/Tag/Class/Spec/Avatar，再清黑板。\n先订阅OnAbilityTerminationCompleted，\nTryActivateAbilityWithTerminationBoundary\n只提交原Handle，不按Class换Spec。\n保存Result的固定Original；同步历史已封存。\n未取得可等待原身份→清自身等待并失败。",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "execute",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5A. Accepted → 固定Original。\n同步读原完成历史；异步\nHandleTerminationCompleted匹配原Completed。\nCleanupBinding→原正常Succeeded/取消Failed，\n再FinishLatentTask；不以End广播冒充完成。\n[[BossAI/结构|GA原资源链]]；正式BT动态未验。",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fail",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5B. 来源/配置失效、GAS拒绝或Busy→Failed；\n未取得可等待原身份不换Spec、不自动排队。\nCleanupBinding只撤本等待订阅；Abort/销毁\n不强制Cancel，不用OnTaskFinished清后继。\n重选/种子/附身/EndPlay清Controller短期请求；\nBaseWeight=0不被恢复逻辑启用。",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "recover",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3A. 合格候选惩罚全部耗尽。\nSelectAction 只恢复这些候选 BaseWeight，再继续本次抽签。\nRepeatPenalty=0 是软避重；唯一合法动作可再次选择。\n不恢复被目标/GAS 过滤的动作，不新增计时器。",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "tick",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "candidates",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "全集校验通过 → 按 Phase 的 ActionSet 筛选"
    },
    {
